# Text is stored with LF on every OS (Godot writes LF)
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Art, audio, fonts and video go through Git LFS (DEC-0027; DEC-0029). The same list lives in
# docs/design/visual-e-audio.md, and tools/check_assets.sh proves it through git check-attr.
